I am in the office.
It is very cool in the office.
I am standing near a big window.
My colleague Rohan comes there.
We look outside through the window.
There is harsh sun outside.
Rohan looks outside and says,
"Maya, it is very hot outside today."
"I do not like this sun at all."
I smile and tell him,
"Yes Rohan, there is a lot of sun today."
"But I saw the weather forecast."
"It will definitely rain this evening."
Rohan is surprised.
He asks, "Really?"
"Will it rain today?"
I say, "Yes, the weather will change in the evening."
Rohan smiles happily.
He says, "This is very good news."
We look outside the window again.
I wait for the rain now.
